; ==============================================================================
;  LiteStep Enhanced - 日本語: the pixel font has no CJK glyphs and is made for size 8
;  without smoothing. Text uses Yu Gothic UI, larger and smoothed; the clock
;  keeps the pixel font (MMClockFont).
; ==============================================================================
MMFont "Yu Gothic UI"
MMFontSmall "Yu Gothic UI"
MMFontSize 11
MMTextAA GrayScale
